WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.402
The supplied fictional primary option needs a responsible

00:00:03.448 --> 00:00:07.314
person's review and permission. The thirty-day action is

00:00:07.361 --> 00:00:10.670
to seek that permission, prepare safe review material,

00:00:11.262 --> 00:00:14.385
retain the questions, and compare the prototype with

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.451
the agreed requirement by the end of thirty

00:00:16.521 --> 00:00:20.793
days. Identify the owner, needed permission, evidence checkpoint,

00:00:21.002 --> 00:00:24.120
and limit. If permission is not established, do

00:00:24.201 --> 00:00:27.278
not use live customer inputs. The backup is

00:00:27.324 --> 00:00:30.552
a clearly labeled fictional review using permitted examples,

00:00:30.958 --> 00:00:34.348
with the organizational gap still visible. This is

00:00:34.395 --> 00:00:37.053
a proposed action, not evidence of a completed

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.014
review or a promised pilot. Save the language

00:00:40.049 --> 00:00:45.436
set, Truth Test, three-option map, choices, boundaries, and

00:00:45.517 --> 00:00:49.294
action in the existing positioning record. Explain the

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:50.594
gap in your own words.
